  "description": "The 'Bang family' who are said to be popular than most of the celebrities. This wealthy, prolific but humble family does not hesitate to do anything to get attention. Unfortunately, the youngest daughter, Bang Eun-hae, who pursues pathologically ordinary life among the attention seeker's family. Her life goal is to 'live like air'. However her family launches a ‘TV reality program’ which shows their daily life. The youngest daughter, Bang Eun-hae, tries to ruin the program, but rather gets the public's attention, and to make matters worse, she falls in love at first sight with the hot actress, Jang Hwi-min! In the meantime, she finds out that her childhood friend, Young-Won Nam, has a crush on her, and it is a continuation of confusion! ''A life like the air, the excitement that you feel for the first time, a being who understands you''. What should Eunhae protect and what should she give up? \n\n(Source: Kakao, translated) \n\n*Note: The chapter count includes 7 side stories.*",
